cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VIGÍA or its evaluation methodology, please cite it."
title: "VIGÍA: Multi-Hazard Early Detection for Existing Camera Infrastructure"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Baranda"
    given-names: "Jon Andoni"
    email: jonandoni.baranda@gmail.com
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jandoni/vigia"
abstract: >
  A gated multi-hazard detection pipeline for existing municipal cameras:
  published detectors for fire, flood, people in water and building access
  behind a shared, hazard-agnostic temporal validator, with licence
  isolation, privacy boundaries and figure provenance enforced by
  build-failing guards. Every published number is generated from committed
  measurement files.
